+| declaration | `Klean8SumProduct.Lemmas.targetStatement` |
+| file | `Klean8SumProduct/Lemmas.lean` |
+| definition SHA-256 | `55b08aa8a5b59441f5a76fe44add2c5df625679fa17315679d177dbeebdd5c35` |
